  "description": "The SCOTT Addict Gravel Premium bike delivers a top-tier off-road experience, blending versatility, comfort, and pinnacle ride quality. It’s built to excel on local routes, and multi-day tours alike, with capacity and adaptability that discerning riders expect.\n\nComfort is at the heart of its design with the HMX carbon frame tuned for the gravel experience to feel balanced, controlled, yet swift riding on any terrain you explore. It’s efficient on the flats, composed in the rougher sections, and capable of so much more. Tire clearance sits as a massive 57mm, so gearing up for seriously untamed terrain is much more inviting. With the high-volume tread underneath you, there’s grip, control, and smoother rolling to boost your stamina for bigger journeys.\n\nWe’ve made the Addict Gravel Premium practical, too, with features that make it versatile and flexible to handle the various rides on your wishlist. The downtube stores your essentials, including our “Save-The-Day” kit with everything you need to handle a flat. It’s a convenient way to carry tools and open up the frame for more gear packs. The bar ends also discreetly store a Syncros handlebar tool and tubeless kit, while extra bottle-cage mounts on the fork provide more on-board hydration for big days. And to keep go-to items close by, the top-tube mounts can hold a small frame bag.\n\nYour shifting experience and drivetrain are top-tier. SRAM’s RED XPLR AXS drivetrain delivers smooth, powerful shifting, and one-finger braking makes hand fatigue almost disappear over long hours in the saddle. The gravel-specific 10–46t cassette gives you a gearing range for most terrain you’ll explore.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
